<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">DSSmoothing: Toward Certified Dataset Ownership Verification 
<br class="ltx_break">for Pre-trained Language Models via Dual-Space Smoothing</h1>
<span class="ltx_pubnotes ltx_pubnotes_meta"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_ccs"><span class="ltx_note_name">CCS: </span>Security and privacy Data security and privacy</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_ccs"><span class="ltx_note_name">CCS: </span>Security and privacy Data transparency and provenance</span></span></span>
