<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S5.F10.sf1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">(a)</span> </span><span id="S5.F10.sf1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">SST-2 (BadWord)</span></figcaption>
