</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib42" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Zhang et al<span id="bib.bib42.2" class="ltx_text">.</span> (2024)</span>
